    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1088">

                <pb facs="1130" n="1120" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1120"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/7–1149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister-Counselor of Embassy in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canton</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-11T17:00:00+08:00">July 11, 1949—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 13—8:58 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cantel 730. In effort get our views regarding bombing to Generalissimo camp,
                    explained our position [to] Hollington Tong<anchor n="41" xml:id="d1088-f1"/>
                    today, Cantel 663, June 28. He agreed we had point and I gather my remarks will
                    reach Generalissimo. In any event, should I see Generalissimo while he is in
                    Canton, shall discuss matter direct with him.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1088-f1" n="41" xml:id="d1088-f1-content">
                <p>Director of the Kuomintang Information Department.</p>
            </note>
